  "rationale": "67 units of Cream 500ML at Dark store 05 (South Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the online sell-by deadline on 2026-09-23; doing nothing writes off ₹12792 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹12130. This play uses a bundle with SKU-CREAM-BUN-400G at ₹285 for 321 consented customers (Personal care regulars, Sweets occasionals, Everyday staples shoppers, Tea connoisseurs, Premium Tea regulars, Household essentials buyers): expected 32 units, margin ₹815, discount cost ₹959, waste avoided ₹6106 (CI 2 to 93 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" This bundle play pairs the Cream 500ML with Cream Bun 400G at a bundle price of 285 INR, which respects the 8.0% dairy margin floor while avoiding 6105.94 INR of waste. It is highly preferred by policy over blanket markdowns.",
